#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-esc-calibration.rst:5
#: 5a7472e9b6264e4e8f05f60b9a1b8249
msgid "Traditional Helicopter — ESC Calibration"
msgstr "传统直升机 — ESC 校准"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-esc-calibration.rst:7
#: 6e85809972d54aefaa9b585ef9b3e4f0
msgid ""
"This page covers specific details about calibrating the ESC for a "
"helicopter.  If using the ESC's internal governor, ESC calibration is not "
"required."
msgstr "本页面介绍有关直升机 ESC 校准的具体细节。如果使用 ESC 的内置调速器，则不需要 ESC 校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-esc-calibration.rst:10
#: 7f6377bce07f48f69491b2ae29bd92b2
msgid "be sure to remove all blades when doing ESC calibration."
msgstr "进行 ESC 校准时务必拆除所有桨叶。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-esc-calibration.rst:12
#: 4d0752d0ca48404696237f915c3c7a1c
msgid ""
"Some ESCs must be calibrated to the throttle range (ie HeliRSC output range,"
" which defaults to 1000 to 2000us). In addition, it is often required to "
"change ESC settings, such as enabling the governor mode and/or setting "
"voltage protection levels."
msgstr ""
"某些 ESC 必须校准到油门范围（即 HeliRSC 输出范围，默认为 1000 到 2000us）。此外，通常需要更改 ESC "
"设置，例如启用调速器模式和/或设置电压保护级别。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-esc-calibration.rst:14
#: 1d7e66f13eff437eac38fed631a6bef3
msgid ""
"In order to do this, you must be able to directly control the input to the "
"ESC. By default the output function where it is attached is set to HeliRSC "
"(:ref:`SERVO8_FUNCTION<SERVO8_FUNCTION>` = 31). In order to pass the "
"throttle stick directly to the ESC for ESC programming per the ESC's "
"instructions, temporarily change this to "
":ref:`SERVO8_FUNCTION<SERVO8_FUNCTION>` = 53. Remember to change it back to "
"\"31\", after completing the ESC programming."
msgstr ""
"为此，您必须能够直接控制输入到 ESC 的信号。默认情况下，ESC 连接的输出功能设置为 "
"HeliRSC（:ref:`SERVO8_FUNCTION<SERVO8_FUNCTION>` = 31）。为了按照 ESC 说明直接将油门摇杆传递到 "
"ESC 进行 ESC 编程，请临时将其更改为 :ref:`SERVO8_FUNCTION<SERVO8_FUNCTION>` = 53。完成 ESC "
"编程后，记得将其改回\"31\"。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-esc-calibration.rst:16
#: 90b9012cbc994374bf716a4ab70abccc
msgid ""
"In addition, check to see that :ref:`RC3_MIN<RC3_MIN>` and "
":ref:`RC3_MAX<RC3_MAX>` match the MIN and MAX range of the HeliRSC output, "
"which defaults to SERVO8 output (:ref:`SERVO8_MIN<SERVO8_MIN>`, "
":ref:`SERVO8_MAX<SERVO8_MAX>`), since passing through the throttle input "
"will be direct and ignore those values, hich you are trying to match in the "
"calibration. If not, temporarily change them to  match and then return them "
"to the values when :ref:`common-radio-control-calibration` was done."
msgstr ""
"此外，检查 :ref:`RC3_MIN<RC3_MIN>` 和 :ref:`RC3_MAX<RC3_MAX>` 是否与 HeliRSC 输出的 MIN "
"和 MAX 范围匹配，该输出默认为 SERVO8 "
"输出（:ref:`SERVO8_MIN<SERVO8_MIN>`，:ref:`SERVO8_MAX<SERVO8_MAX>`），因为直通油门输入将是直接的，会忽略这些值，而您在校准中试图匹配的正是这些值。如果不匹配，请临时更改以匹配，然后在"
" :ref:`common-radio-control-calibration` 完成后恢复原值。"
